        {
          "text": "’ba dria asi teza be ’diyi yi enga ra, yi mu lini be rra, yi o’du Saulo pi ma ave, anzi erini ’diyi ma avu pie, engazu abi Beti-sanini ma ruaasi; yi emu Yabesia, eve yi ’daa, ",
          "type": "text",
